graph LR
  classDef ext fill:#dff0d8,stroke:#3c763d,stroke-width:2px
  classDef proc fill:#eef3fb,stroke:#31708f,stroke-width:3px

  APP([Applicant]):::ext
  STU([Student]):::ext
  TEA([Teacher/HOD]):::ext
  CLK([Clerk]):::ext
  LIB([Librarian]):::ext
  TTB([Timetable In-charge]):::ext
  MGT([Principal/Admin]):::ext
  BANK([Bank]):::ext

  SYS((0<br/><br/>Online College<br/>Management System<br/>OCMS)):::proc

  APP -->|application, documents, fee proof| SYS
  SYS -->|merit position, challan, admission status| APP

  STU -->|classwork submission, quiz answers, book request| SYS
  SYS -->|attendance, marks, timetable, fee status, student card| STU

  TEA -->|attendance marking, marks entry, classwork| SYS
  SYS -->|class lists, allocations, department load| TEA

  CLK -->|document verification, merit generation, challan verification, promotion| SYS
  SYS -->|verification queue, merit lists, student records| CLK

  LIB -->|catalogue updates, issue and return| SYS
  SYS -->|requests, overdue list, fine amounts| LIB

  TTB -->|blocks, rooms, slots, timetable entries| SYS
  SYS -->|conflict warnings, published timetable| TTB

  MGT -->|settings, permissions, staff accounts| SYS
  SYS -->|dashboards, audit trail, statistics| MGT

  SYS -->|printed challan| BANK
  BANK -->|paid counterfoil| CLK
